	## Goal
	Understand how much value is lost to slippage and market impact.
	
	## Current Tracking (main.go:503-518)
	- Slippage: (fillPrice - lastPrice) / lastPrice
	- Theft: deviation from expected quote
	
	## Analysis
	- Slippage distribution by side (buy vs sell)
	- Slippage vs order size
	- Slippage vs spread deviation (do strong signals have more slippage?)
	- Time-of-day patterns
	
	## Questions
	- Is slippage predictable?
	- Should we adjust size based on expected slippage?
	- Are there market microstructure patterns to exploit?
